<title>PHILIPPINES: Asian Pacific Q3 net loss 1.22 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Asian Pacific Q3 net loss 1.22 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Pacific Equity Corp said on Tuesday it posted a net loss of 1.22 million pesos in the third quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not available.</p>
<p>Revenues of the financial company reached 7.416 million pesos, while total cost and expenses amounted to 8.636 million pesos. - Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
